  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In an experiment of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></math> configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></math> transistor, the transfer characteristics are observed as given in figure.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0089_e58f1eef5b22.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 243px;\" /></p><p>If the input resistance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> and output resistance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>, the voltage gain in this experiment will be _____ .</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0089_4badcf97b089.png\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p>Voltage gain,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math><br />Input Resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />Output Resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
